                    <p class="rd-summary">Skyr is an Icelandic specialty that lies between yogurt and cream cheese. It is lower in fat than Greek yogurt and is rich in protein (2.5 times more than regular yogurt). A perfect ally for health and weight loss, it can be added to desserts for guilt-free indulgence. Enjoy the deliciousness of our skyr cake with chocolate chips, guaranteed to be extra fresh!</p>
