        			<section id="rd-faq" class="faq-list"><h2 id="ref-faq" class="title">FAQ ❓</h2><div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#faq0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq0" >What is skyr?</h3><div id="faq0" class="collapse show"><div class="faq-answer">Skyr is an Icelandic yogurt made from skimmed milk. It is very low in fat and high in protein.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><h3 class="faq-question collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#faq1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq1" >What can replace skyr?</h3><div id="faq1" class="collapse "><div class="faq-answer">You can use 0% fat cottage cheese as a substitute for skyr.</div></div></div></section>		
